+//! Reconciliation creation, conflict choices and the invalidation of a recorded
+//! choice.
+//!
+//! Authority. A reconciliation Workspace is created from
+//! `LayerStackStore::prepare_reconciliation` and owns that prepared object graph
+//! through `LayerStackStore::reconciliation_reader`: the private candidate
+//! objects are *not* part of the committed Store, so this reader is the only way
